{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\hist\\029.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unit 02 Spread of Islam", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[382, 104], [525, 106], [525, 127], [382, 124]]}, {"text": "Conquests in Spain", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[77, 130], [303, 137], [302, 164], [76, 158]]}, {"text": "achieved great victories in Africa and Spain. Tarig Bin Ziyad conquered Spain in 711 when", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[73, 192], [833, 203], [833, 231], [73, 219]]}, {"text": " he defeated King Roderick.", "conf": 0.866, "box": [[67, 217], [312, 223], [312, 246], [67, 241]]}, {"text": "In750AD,Ummayad rule inDamascusceased toexistandwas replaced bytheAbbasids.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[75, 257], [829, 268], [829, 291], [75, 280]]}, {"text": "However, the rule of Ummayad was renewed in 756 in Spain which continued till 1492.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[76, 281], [829, 292], [829, 317], [76, 305]]}, {"text": "During this period Spain became a centre of education, art and architecture. This rule is", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[77, 306], [830, 318], [830, 341], [77, 330]]}, {"text": "alsoknown for religious tolerance.", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[76, 331], [379, 337], [378, 360], [76, 354]]}, {"text": "FactstoKnow", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[206, 404], [356, 408], [355, 431], [205, 428]]}, {"text": "Ummayad's rule inSpain is considered tobea goldenperiod of", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[205, 425], [741, 431], [740, 452], [205, 446]]}, {"text": "this region.The prominent rulers of this age were AbdulRahman-l.", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[204, 445], [752, 453], [751, 476], [203, 468]]}, {"text": "and Abdul Rahman-l.", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[212, 468], [402, 472], [401, 493], [211, 488]]}, {"text": "Use different sources to find about the", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[203, 500], [584, 505], [584, 529], [203, 525]]}, {"text": "art,architecture,", "conf": 0.866, "box": [[587, 506], [737, 511], [736, 532], [587, 528]]}, {"text": "literature,science andtechnologyof", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[204, 524], [557, 530], [557, 552], [203, 546]]}, {"text": "erawhichwas", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[606, 530], [746, 533], [745, 553], [606, 550]]}, {"text": "introduced bythe Mulims in Spain.", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[205, 547], [503, 552], [503, 572], [204, 567]]}, {"text": "JabalalTariqorGibraltarinSpain", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[349, 994], [566, 994], [566, 1011], [349, 1011]]}, {"text": "During the time of Caliph Umar Bin Abdul Aziz, many Berbers in North Africa embraced", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[80, 1024], [826, 1020], [826, 1048], [80, 1052]]}, {"text": "Islam because of his kind behaviour towards the minorities. By the end of Umayad", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[79, 1050], [827, 1044], [827, 1073], [79, 1079]]}, {"text": "Central Asia and the Subcontinent in the east.", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[79, 1104], [481, 1094], [482, 1120], [79, 1131]]}]}